<item>
            <title>[LU-20942] conf-sanity test_73e, test_88a, test_250 fail against 2.17.0 servers</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20942</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;conf-sanity test_73e, test_88a and test_250 fail every time in interop testing against 2.17.0 servers (Test-Parameters serverversion=2.17), because they test server changes that landed after 2.17.0 and their version checks do not exclude 2.17.0:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;test_73e: &quot;check client /mnt/lustre failed&quot; after &quot;Try to mount after MGS remount&quot;.  That part of the test was added with the server fix 089f438ba9a5 (&quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19692&quot; title=&quot;MGS NID tables are lost after failover and need to be rebuilt&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-19692&quot;&gt;LU-19692&lt;/a&gt; mgc: notify MGS about target NIDs after reconnect&quot;, v2_17_50-34), but the test only checks for MDS &amp;gt;= 2.16.57.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;test_88a: &quot;test_88a returned 127&quot;, parsing the 2.17.0 tunefs.lustre output.  Added with 23b31c5db51a (&quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20360&quot; title=&quot;tunefs.lustre silently ignores --mountfsoptions-only changes&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-20360&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-20360&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; utils: fix tunefs.lustre dropping mountfsoptions&quot;, v2_17_54-97), with no version check.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;test_250: &quot;lcfg_erase did not list erased parameters&quot;.  Added with f5e198dc687a (&quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18951&quot; title=&quot;remove llog params records when erasing filesystem&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-18951&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18951&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; utils: lctl lcfg_erase erase fsname params&quot;, v2_17_51-23), but checks for MGS &amp;gt;= 2.16.54.86.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Seen in every custom serverversion=2.17 conf-sanity session for 64202, 68474 and 66529, e.g. &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/f8677e45-d2c9-48e2-9369-247f25ae08f5&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/f8677e45-d2c9-48e2-9369-247f25ae08f5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
